<p>Improves your undead body, increasing Strength and Magic by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 5, 7, 9, 10.</acronym></p><p>Each time you move you gain a charge (up to <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 2, 3, 4, 5</acronym>) of death momentum, increasing your movement speed by 20%.</p><p>Each turn spent not moving you lose a charge.</p>